  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Sector Development Credit II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project is to assist Mongolian in its efforts to promote private and financial sector development and reinforcing the institutional capacity of the banking sector by (i) increasing the availability of commercial bank term lending to investment enterprises, (ii) strengthening the financial intermediation function and resource allocation capabilities of the participating financial institutions; (iii) strengthening Bank of Mongolia#s financial supervision functions; and (iv) underpinning the Ministry of Finance#s role in fostering private sector growth and a sound Mongolian financial sector.</narrative>
  </description>
